From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 08:58:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make resumed conversations available during skill discovery

Preserve the existing background skill discovery and watch-registration behavior. Keep a second tracing dispatch alive in the five observer tests so concurrent untraced calls cannot disable their shared span callsites. Assertions and deadlines remain unchanged.

The original independent patch tree differs only by the 15 tracing-guard lines. The authoring queue and a fresh candidate checkout pass maintained just fmt-check. Native validation and emitted queue acceptance are tracked separately by the CI repair task.
